# Morocco: The Mohammadia College of Engineering

**Authors:** Al-Kettani, Hamza

## Abstract
Provides a history and description of the Mohammadia College of Engineering in Rabat, Morocco. Topics discussed include student selection, curriculum, policy implementation, and the teaching staff. The author concludes that the college does an excellent job in training qualified engineers for public works, mining, electrical and mechanical engineering fields. (Author/DB)

